flowchart LR
 _Prelude_(["Blend into the crowd, wait for the flash mob to start, then help yourself to some loot!"])
 _A0_(["The crew makes its way into the mall, acting natural to avoid raising the alarm."])
 _A1_(["Waiting for the flash mob to begin, the team window shops while scouting the area."])
 _A1_1_(["Suspicious-looking groups enter the mall from all directions—the flash mobbers are here."])
 _A1_C1_{"Looter #1 reminds the others to stay calm and pretend they haven&#39;t noticed."}
 _A1_C1F_["A store owner notices Looter #2 staring at the flash mob and secures her door."]
 _A1_2_(["The flash mob descends on the team&#39;s position. There&#39;s little room to move."])
 _A1_C2_{"Amid the frenzy, Looter #2 tries to shoulder-barge the store door discreetly."}
 _A1_C2F_["Despite Looter #2&#39;s best efforts, the door holds firm."]
 _A1_C3_{"Looter #3 pulls out his Jemmy and tries to pry the door open."}
 _A1_C3P_["The door cracks around the lock, allowing the team to gain entry."]
 _A1_4_(["Opportunistic shoppers flood in, snatching up the goods and leaving little for the crew."])
 _A1_9_(["Wary of things getting out of hand, the team bounces and looks for another venue to hit."])
 _A2_3_Cont_(["Looter #1 wants a new timepiece and suggests they hit the watch store."])
 _A2_3_Cont2_(["The swollen crowd causes a bottleneck to form in the center of the mall."])
 _A2_C1_{"Seeing an opening, Looter #2 starts shoving his way through the horde."}
 _A2_C1P_["Using his instincts, Looter #2 guides the team through the throng of people."]
 _A3_(["The team arrives at the watch store. The lights are on but there are no shoppers inside."])
 _A3_1_(["Looter #2 tries to open the store door but it&#39;s been locked from the inside."])
 _A3_C1_{"Looter #3 pulls out a concealed Jemmy and tries to pry the door open."}
 _A3_C1F_["The door resists Looter #3&#39;s effort, its hinges creaking without giving way."]
 _A3_C2_{"Looter #4 grabs a potted plant and uses it to smash the lock on the door."}
 _A3_C2P_["With each strike, the lock weakens until it finally gives way with a satisfying crack."]
 _A4_(["The shopkeepers rush to the door, pushing the team back outside."])
 _A4_C1_{"Looter #2 kicks the door like an unhinged lunatic, eager to break in."}
 _A4_C1P_["The door shatters due to the force and the shopkeepers back away."]
 _A5_(["The shopkeepers run and hide behind the counter to avoid confrontation."])
 _A5_1_(["With no one to stop them, the team spreads out and starts looting watches."])
 _A5_2_(["Hearing a radio crackle, Looter #4 steps out of the boutique and runs into a guard."])
 _A5_C1_{"Looter #4 attempts to wind the guard with a gut-punch to the diaphragm."}
 _A5_C1P_["The guard doubles over, unable to intervene as he struggles to breathe."]
 _A7_(["The team exits the boutique, seeing Looter #4 dragging the guard toward the store."])
 _A7_1_(["Grabbing one limb each, the gang dumps the guard in the boutique and makes for the exit."])
 _A7_2_(["As the crew climbs into the car, another security guard approaches."])
 _A7_C1_{"Looter #2 launches a punch at the guard to get her to back off."}
 _A7_C1F_["Looter #2&#39;s jab misses, allowing the guard to retrieve some watches in the melee."]
 _A7_4_(["Realizing it&#39;s a 4-on-1 situation, the guard backs down."])
 _A7S2_(["Looter #3 puts his foot on the gas and drives the team away to safety."])
 _A1_C2P_["After several attempts, the door comes off its hinges and the team enters the store."]
 _A1_3_(["With the store to themselves, the team robs a large haul of high-quality merchandise."])
 _A1_8_(["As Looter #2 empties the register, opportunistic shoppers join in the looting."])
 _A2_C1F_["As Looter #2 pushes forward, the opening narrows and the team’s path is blocked."]
 _A2_C2_{"Looter #4 starts elbowing people in the ribs to force them to move."}
 _A2_C2P_["Looter #4&#39;s approach makes the crowd part, allowing the team to proceed."]
 _A3_C2F_["The lock is too sturdy and the planter shatters in Looter #4&#39;s hands."]
 _A3_C3_{"Looter #1 pulls out her Jemmy and takes aim at the display window."}
 _A3_C3F_["The Jemmy rebounds off the glass and strikes Looter #2 in the head."]
 _A3_5_(["Looter #2 snaps at Looter #1 and demands that she hand over the Jemmy."])
 _A3_C4_{"Looter #2 jabs the Jemmy&#39;s claw into the window, hoping to carve out an opening."}
 _A3_C4F_["Looter #2 fails to break the display window—the glass must be toughened."]
 _A3_7_(["The team loses patience and decides to move to another store."])
 _D1_1_(["Looter #3 spots some luxury handbags on display."])
 _D1_C1_{"Wielding the Jemmy, Looter #3 charges into the store and threatens the owner."}
 _D1_C1P_["Seeing Looter #3&#39;s psychotic expression, the shopkeeper opens up the display case."]
 _D3_(["The team loots numerous expensive handbags from the display."])
 _D3_1_(["With their hands full, the team runs to the getaway car with their stolen loot."])
 _D3_2_(["Overloaded, Looter #2 and Looter #4 drop some handbags along the way."])
 _D3S_(["Throwing their loot into the trunk, the team gets in the car and speeds off."])
 _A5_C1F_["The guard&#39;s considerable breadbasket absorbs the punch and he stands firm."]
 _A5_3_(["Surprisingly nimble, the guard counters deftly, seizing Looter #4 in a chokehold."])
 _A5_4_(["The team exits the boutique and finds Looter #4 grappling with the guard."])
 _A5_C2_{"Looter #1 twists the guard&#39;s arm as the others pepper his body with punches."}
 _A5_C2F_["The guard headbutts Looter #1, freeing himself from the arm lock."]
 _A5_7_(["A second guard joins the fray and downs Looter #3 with a baton strike to the knee."])
 _A5F_(["The two guards dominate the fight and the whole crew ends up in handcuffs."])
 _A1_C1P_["As the flash mob moves into place, the crew loiters with intent."]
 _A2_(["Cell phones start ringing out across the mall."])
 _A2_1_(["Looter #1 checks his phone. The message reads, “Let the games begin!”"])
 _A2_2_(["The flash mob descends on the mall, knocking over displays and harassing shoppers."])
 _A2_3_(["Amid the chaos, the team snatches some fancy perfumes from a nearby stall."])
 _A4_C1F_["The shopkeepers hold steady. Looter #2 looks frustrated."]
 _A4_1_(["Looter #1 notices some hand sanitizer in a dispenser near the entrance."])
 _A4_C2_{"Looter #1 smears the door with hand sanitizer and sets it on fire."}
 _A4_C2P_["The sanitizer&#39;s high alcohol content causes the door to burst into flames."]
 _B1_(["The shopkeepers barge through the burning door and run away."])
 _B1_1_(["As the fire spreads, the team fans out and starts looting watches."])
 _B1_2_(["The fire causes the doorway to collapse, blocking the team&#39;s only way out."])
 _B1_C1_{"Looter #4 picks up a metal display cabinet and launches it at the window."}
 _B1_C1F_["The cabinet bounces off the toughened glass window, having no effect."]
 _B3_(["A group of flash mobbers notices the team&#39;s predicament as they exit the mall."])
 _B3_1_(["They work to remove the debris, creating a small opening for the crew to slip through."])
 _B3_2_(["The team is able to squeeze through one by one but is forced to leave some loot behind."])
 _B3S_(["Charred and down on their luck, the team retreats to the safety of their getaway car."])
 _A2_C2F_["Despite Looter #4&#39;s aggressive tactics, there&#39;s no way through the mass of people."]
 _A2_4_(["Changing tack, the team heads to the luxury home furnishings outlet."])
 _A2_5_(["There&#39;s an array of expensive silverware stored inside a locked glass cabinet."])
 _A2_C3_{"Looter #2 and Looter #3 try to tip the cabinet over to smash it open."}
 _A2_C3P_["The cabinet topples to the floor and shatters, allowing the team to boost its contents."]
 _A2_6_(["Their pockets full of expensive tableware, the team moves on in search of more plunder."])
 _A3_C3P_["Looter #1 shatters the window completely, causing the shopkeepers to bolt."]
 _A3_4_(["With unfettered access to the display, the team cleans out every luxury watch in sight."])
 _D1_(["Having filled their pockets, the team moves on to another vendor."])
 _D1_C1F_["The shopkeeper refuses to play ball, so Looter #3 smashes his shin with the tool."]
 _D2_(["A store assistant intervenes and challenges Looter #3 to a fight."])
 _D2_1_(["He dodges Looter #3&#39;s attacks and gets in a few punches before being subdued."])
 _D2_2_(["Noticing the fracas, several shoppers join in, forcing the team to drop the loot and run."])
 _D2F_(["The crew makes it to the getaway car and drives Looter #3 to hospital."])
 _A7_C1P_["An explosive left hook connects with the guard&#39;s nose, shattering it into a bloody mess."]
 _A7_3_(["As the guard clutches her face, Looter #2 enters the car and signals to leave."])
 _A7S_(["The team drives off with their haul of stolen goods."])
 _A3_C1P_["The door gives way with a crack, allowing the team to enter the watch store."]
 _B1_C1P_["The window shatters on impact, allowing the team to exit through the frame."]
 _B2_(["Fleeing the inferno, the team makes a hasty retreat to the getaway car."])
 _B2S_(["Looter #2 puts the key in the ignition and burns rubber."])
 _A5_C2P_["The assault on the guard renders him unconscious."]
 _A5_5_(["As the team rushes to the car, a second guard comes to investigate the commotion."])
 _A5_6_(["Wielding a baton, the guard charges at the crew, making them drop some valuable loot."])
 _A2_C3F_["The cabinet topples over but fails to open. Looter #2 spits on the floor in anger."]
 _A2_7_(["After wasting too much time, Looter #1 insists they look for a different vendor."])
 _A2_8_(["Exiting the store, the crew runs into the guards as they&#39;re rounding up flash mobbers."])
 _A2F_(["With nowhere to run, the entire team is cornered, cuffed, and booked."])
 _A4_C2F_["Flames engulf Looter #1&#39;s loot bag, forcing  him to drop it with a shriek."]
 _A4F_(["Looter #4 tries to stamp out the flames but he catches fire too!"])
 _A4F_Cont_(["The team wraps Looter #4 in their jackets to quell the fire, exiting the scene."])
 _A3_C4P_["Looter #2 creates a hole in the glass wide enough to reach through."]
 _A3_6_(["Through the gap, Looter #2 grabs a selection of watches, giving them to the crew."])
 _A1_C3F_["Somehow, the door and its frame remain intact. Looter #3 curses loudly."]
 _A1_5_(["The flash mobbers notice what&#39;s going on and become irate."])
 _A1_6_(["Looter #3 swings his Jemmy to ward them off, but the crowd draws in."])
 _A1_7_(["Vastly outnumbered, the team is forced to surrender themselves to the mob."])
 _A1F_(["A brace of guards arrives and the whole team is arrested."])

